3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.029
And then we heard about a flower shop

4
00:00:08.029 --> 00:00:11.458
in Oklahoma City that was changing the lives

5
00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:13.880
of the homeless in their community,

6
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.900
and then we thought maybe this is a perfect match.

7
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.920
Absolutely, just the coolest.

8
00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:21.473
Okay, let's meet them, take a look.

9
00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.910 line:15%
Hi, Drew, my name is Ranya.

10
00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:26.620 line:15%
And I'm Jordan, we've been friends

11
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.163 line:15%
since elementary school and together we run

12
00:00:29.163 --> 00:00:31.490
Curbside Flowers.
Curbside Flowers.

13
00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.919
Back on Valentine's Day in 2016,

14
00:00:33.919 --> 00:00:36.360
we, along with The Homeless Alliance,

15
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.410
had the idea to start creating and selling bouquets

16
00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:41.780
of flowers as a way to provide work

17
00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:45.702
and income to people in our city experiencing homelessness.

18
00:00:45.702 --> 00:00:47.370
We've received so much love

19
00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:49.840
and support from the community and at the same time,

20
00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.566
we are raising awareness and putting a face

21
00:00:51.566 --> 00:00:54.390
to the issue of homelessness in Oklahoma City.

22
00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:55.585
We want to help people see someone

23
00:00:55.585 --> 00:00:58.280
beyond just the problem that they faced.

24
00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:00.470
Flowers are beautiful and so are people.

25
00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.230
And if we work together as a community,

26
00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:04.895
we can help our neighbors in their homelessness.

27
00:01:04.895 --> 00:01:08.310
Thanks, Drew, can't wait to talk to you soon.

28
00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:15.883
Wow, Ranya and Jordan are joining Ayesha and I now.

29
00:01:15.883 --> 00:01:19.439
Hi, guys.
(audience loudly cheering)

30
00:01:19.439 --> 00:01:20.522
Hi, Ayesha.

31
00:01:21.371 --> 00:01:23.055
Hi, hi, you guys!

32
00:01:23.055 --> 00:01:25.216
So nice to meet you.
So cool.

33
00:01:25.216 --> 00:01:28.004
Thank you so much for coming here today.

34
00:01:28.004 --> 00:01:30.830
Your operation looks just beautiful.

35
00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:34.930
Can you explain the impact

36
00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:37.590
that your organization is having

37
00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:39.668
on your community right now?

38
00:01:39.668 --> 00:01:43.780 line:15%
Curbside Flowers is a program of The Homeless Alliance

39
00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:47.042 line:15%
and we operate just like any traditional flower shop,

40
00:01:47.042 --> 00:01:51.010
but we are a nonprofit and we employ people transitioning

41
00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:53.230
out of homelessness in our community.

42
00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:56.460
So we are helping remove barriers to employment for folks

43
00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:59.620
so that they can earn income, build job skills,

44
00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:02.320
and regain stability in their lives.

45
00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:05.954
We have also teamed up with a local college

46
00:02:05.954 --> 00:02:10.105
so that our participants can earn certifications,

47
00:02:10.105 --> 00:02:13.510
which is such an incredible experience for them.

48
00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:16.948
We employ 10 people in our flower shop year-round

49
00:02:16.948 --> 00:02:20.584 line:15%
but seasonally at Valentine's Day, like this week,

50
00:02:20.584 --> 00:02:22.773 line:15%
we get to hire additional employees.

51
00:02:22.773 --> 00:02:24.720 line:15%
So this Valentine's Day,

52
00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:27.344
we are working with 45 additional people

53
00:02:27.344 --> 00:02:30.141
working to end their-
(audience loudly applauding)

54
00:02:30.141 --> 00:02:31.720
Wow!
That's amazing.

55
00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:36.408
And Jordan, you have a goal this Valentine's Day, right?

56
00:02:36.408 --> 00:02:40.910
