75
00:03:36.795 --> 00:03:38.940 line:15%
Thank you, guys!
Thank you so much!

76
00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:43.200
So, so much and that is incredible, thank you so, so much.

77
00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.853
Excellent, and Ayesha,

78
00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:49.180
